<title>ITALY: Big 96 growth recorded in Turin air cargo traffic.</title>
<headline>Big 96 growth recorded in Turin air cargo traffic.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turin airport handled 55.9 million kg of cargo in 1996, up 115.8 percent on the previous year, said its management company, Sagat.</p>
<p>It said this big increase was due mainly to Alitalia's decision early in the year to switch all of its cargo flights between Italy and North America and the Far East to Turin.</p>
<p>Mail traffic handled by Turin airport last year totalled 2.6 million kg, up 3.2 percent, while passenger numbers rose 9.7 percent to nearly two million.</p>
<p>-Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 8982 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
